## Pi coding agent
# Installed package dependencies (like node_modules) — restored via `pi install`
# from .pi/settings.json on next launch.
.pi/npm/
# Personal model-role overrides (which model backs planner/builder/explorer) —
# see .pi/extensions/eigin/workflow/role-store.ts. Per-developer, not shared.
.pi/model-roles.json

## MacOS
**/.DS_Store
